{"title":"2007 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define the operation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/7/d17950ad2ab63c764778b133f95a03dcf2969d57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\star$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/0/670f16c293beeb2b6896d90e1a0152b299183eb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\star b = (a+b)b.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" /> What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/c/7cc1492f8eecd03f649161a83acd42471bc7d508.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3 \\star 5) - (5 \\star 3)?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e57a6bab7e7c92558d685a15cf1fb68822f915e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } -16 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } -8 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"415\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Substitute and simplify.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/a/17a3171fd336e8778f58d182a02e1600a87f8bcb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(3+5)5 - (5+3)3 = (3+5)2 = 8\\cdot2 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }16}\\]\" width=\"379\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/1/a816cff0fb7159c0d8b06b735391098bfab42295.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a \\star b) - (b \\star a) = (a+b)b - (b+a)a= (a+b)(b-a)= b^2 - a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"504\" height=\"21\" />. We can substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340605c5f88cf6864adc5b146c3dffca7a45df22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/6/4f69c1ec597d19324140f3130e9d63367f4b69c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=5$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/0/fb07763d0af51058046c986f07c9ce4ecf93429e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^2 - 3^2 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"145\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~MathFun1000 (Minor Edits)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B\">2007 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.ph